	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00350" index="350">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hurls hard\nrocks at the foe.\nTwo to five rocks are\nlaunched in quick\nsuccession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00351" index="351">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user strikes the\nfoe with a quick jolt\nof electricity.\nThis attack cannot be\nevaded.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00352" index="352">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the\nfoe with a pulsing\nblast of water.\nIt may also confuse\nthe foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00353" index="353">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Two turns after this\nmove is used, the\nuser blasts the foe\nwith a concentrated\nbundle of light.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00354" index="354">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the\nfoe at full power.\nThe attack’s recoil\nsharply reduces the\nuser’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00355" index="355">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lands and\nrests its body.\nIt restores the\nuser’s HP by up to\nhalf of its max HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00356" index="356">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gravity is intensified\nfor five turns, making\nmoves involving flying\nunusable and\nnegating Levitation.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00357" index="357">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enables the user to\nhit a Dark type with\nany type of move. It\nalso enables the user\nto hit an evasive foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00358" index="358">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This attack inflicts\nhigh damage on a\nsleeping foe. It\nalso wakes the foe\nup, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00359" index="359">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user swings and\nhits with its strong\nand heavy fist.\nIt lowers the user’s\nSpeed, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00360" index="360">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tackles the\nfoe with a high-speed\nspin. The slower the\nuser, the greater\nthe damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00361" index="361">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user faints. In\nreturn, the Pokémon\ntaking its place will\nhave its HP restored\nand status cured.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00362" index="362">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If the foe’s HP is\ndown to about half,\nthis attack will hit\nwith double the\npower.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00363" index="363">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user draws power\nto attack by using\nits held Berry.\nThe Berry determines\nits type and power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00364" index="364">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack that hits a\nfoe using Protect or\nDetect. It also lifts\nthe effects of those\nmoves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00365" index="365">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
