	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00424" index="424">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A hot grill bite. May\nburn or flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00425" index="425">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user extends its\nshadow and attacks\nthe foe from behind.\nThis move always goes\nfirst.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00426" index="426">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user launches a\nhard-packed mud ball\nto attack.\nIt may also lower the\ntarget’s accuracy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00427" index="427">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tears at\nthe foe with blades\nformed by psychic\npower. It has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00428" index="428">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user focuses its\nwillpower to its head\nand rams the foe.\nIt may also make the\ntarget flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00429" index="429">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user looses a\nflash of energy from\nits polished body.\nIt may also lower the\ntarget’s accuracy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00430" index="430">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user gathers all\nits light energy and\nreleases it at once.\nIt may also lower the\nfoe’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00431" index="431">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A charging attack\nthat may also leave\nthe foe confused.\nIt can also be used\nto scale rocky walls.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00432" index="432">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It reduces the foe’s\nevasion stat. It also\nremoves spikes,\nlight screens, etc.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00433" index="433">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user creates a\nbizarre area in which\nslower Pokémon get\nto move first for five\nturns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00434" index="434">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Comets are summoned\ndown from the sky.\nThe attack’s recoil\nsharply reduces the\nuser’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00435" index="435">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A flare of electricity\nis loosed to strike\nall Pokémon in battle.\nIt may also cause\nparalysis.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00436" index="436">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An inferno of scarlet\nflames washes over\nall Pokémon in battle.\nIt may also inflict\nburns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00437" index="437">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A storm of sharp\nleaves is whipped up.\nThe attack’s recoil\nsharply reduces the\nuser’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00438" index="438">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user violently\nwhirls its vines or\ntentacles to harshly\nlash the foe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00439" index="439">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user launches a\nhuge boulder at the\nfoe to attack.\nIt must rest on the\nnext turn, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00440" index="440">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A slashing attack\nthat may also leave\nthe target poisoned.\nIt has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00441" index="441">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user shoots\nfilthy garbage at the\nfoe to attack.\nIt may also poison\nthe target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00442" index="442">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A steel core round.\nMay make the foe\nflinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00443" index="443">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user launches a\nsteel bomb that\nsticks to the target.\nThis attack will not\nmiss.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00444" index="444">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Stone cold. High\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00445" index="445">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If it is the opposite\ngender of the user,\nthe foe is charmed\ninto sharply lowering\nits Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00446" index="446">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lays a trap\nof levitating stones\naround the foe. The\ntrap hurts foes that\nswitch into battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00447" index="447">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user snares the\nfoe with grass and\ntrips it. The heavier\nthe foe, the greater\nthe damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00448" index="448">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks\nusing a sound wave\nbased on words it has\nlearned. It may also\nconfuse the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00449" index="449">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user releases\ncountless shots of\nlight. Its type varies\nwith the kind of Plate\nthe user is holding.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00450" index="450">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user bites the\nfoe. If the foe is\nholding a Berry, the\nuser eats it and\ngains its effect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00451" index="451">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user fires a\nconcentrated bundle\nof electricity. It may\nalso raise the user’s\nSp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00452" index="452">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slams its\nrugged body into the\nfoe to attack. The\nuser also sustains\nserious damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00453" index="453">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lunges at\nthe foe at a speed\nthat makes it almost\ninvisible. It is sure\nto strike first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00454" index="454">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user calls out\nits underlings to\npummel the foe.\nIt has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00455" index="455">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user calls out\nits underlings to\nshield its body,\nraising its Defense\nand Sp. Def stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00456" index="456">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user calls out\nits underlings to heal\nit. The user regains\nup to half of its\nmax HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00457" index="457">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user delivers a\nlife-endangering\nattack at full power.\nThe user also takes\nterrible damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00458" index="458">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slams the\nfoe with a long tail,\nvines, etc. The\ntarget is hit\ntwice in a row.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00459" index="459">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user blasts the\nfoe with power that\ndistorts even time.\nThe user must rest\non the next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00460" index="460">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tears the\nfoe along with the\nspace around it.\nThis move has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00461" index="461">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user faints. In\nreturn, the Pokémon\ntaking its place will\nhave its status and\nHP fully restored.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00462" index="462">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is crushed\nwith great force.\nThe attack is more\npowerful the more HP\nthe foe has left.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00463" index="463">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe becomes\ntrapped within a\nmaelstrom of fire\nthat rages for two\nto five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00464" index="464">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is dragged\ninto a world of total\ndarkness that puts it\nto sleep.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00465" index="465">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user generates\na shock wave from\nwithin its body.\nIt may also lower the\ntarget’s Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00466" index="466">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user creates a\ngust of repulsive\nwind. It may also\nraise all the user’s\nstats at once.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00467" index="467">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user disappears,\nthen strikes the foe\non the second turn.\nIt hits even if the\nfoe protects itself.</language>
	</row>
</body>
